    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        547,
        499,
        1332,
        570
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "§ 2. The exercise of functions, powers and duties by the First Deputy Mayor for, on behalf of and at the direction of the Mayor pursuant to this Executive Order shall not require the consent in writing of the Mayor or any other officer of the City.",
